[{"title":"Contact","field_data_points":false,"field_data_table_format":"{}","body":"<p>We welcome your questions and feedback about how we can improve PanKbase! Please contact us through our <a href="https://github.com/PanKbase/external-feedback/discussions">Community Forum</a> on GitHub or email us at <a href="mailto:help@pankbase.org">help@pankbase.org</a>. If you are reporting a bug, please include the URL of the page you are viewing. We endeavor to answer all queries within two business days.</p>
<h4>Feedback</h4>
<p>We value your feedback and strive to continuously update our resource to reflect the needs of the community. Please <a href="https://forms.gle/tyuYH8Tx2JcQVuuRA">fill out our survey here</a>.</p>
